OL,3,GNEWSAAnton Du Beke's little-known
OL,4,AWolverhampton link
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrictly Come Dancing judge Anton Du
OL,7,FBeke said he is "very excited" to
OL,8,Freturn to Wolverhampton after revealing
OL,9,Fhis little-known history with the city.
OL,11,FThe dancer and television star opened
OL,12,Fup ahead of his festive show, Anton At
OL,13,FChristmas, which he will be performing
OL,14,Fat University of Wolverhampton at The
OL,15,FHalls on 16 December.
OL,17,FThe Black Country city became a
OL,18,Fmemorable part of his rise to ballroom
OL,19,Fstardom as he used to make repeated
OL,20,Ftrips there for his first bespoke
OL,21,Ftailsuit.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
